<title>JAPAN: Japan Dec refined zinc output falls yr/yr--MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan Dec refined zinc output falls yr/yr--MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese refined zinc output in December fell from the same month last year, according to Ministry of International Trade and Industry data released on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The MITI data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		    Dec 96   yr/yr change   Nov 96</p>
<p> Output	   53,179	-4.9	  50,520</p>
<p> Shipments	50,693	-6.4	  50,761</p>
<p> Stocks	   53,105     -33.9	  52,514</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
